<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia urges large finance institutions to merge.</title>
<headline>Malaysia urges large finance institutions to merge.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Deputy Prime Minister and Finance Minister Anwar Ibrahim on Friday urged the country's larger financial institutions to seriously consider mergers.</p>
<p>&quot;I urge the larger financial institutions to give serious considerations to merge and become significant regional players,&quot; Anwar said when presenting the 1997 national budget.</p>
</text>
